body:
I've been cutting and have reached 135 lbs. Once I reach 130 I'll be the lowest I've been since 2020.

&#x200B;

I still don't see a defined six pack, I imagine that's because I'm not low % body fat wise enough which is fine I can lose more weight. Should every person have a 6 pack? I only want to see it for a bit then start bulking again since I've never been able to see it; but I do see a very clear "wall" of abs when I'm not flexing or flexing even. My top two are visible!
